rdm-lucid
A re-implementation of ReMind on Lucid.

This repository ports, to the Lucid framework, code from the projects below.
The ported code is a derivative of them and is distributed under the Creative
Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International license (LICENSE), which
restricts use to non-commercial purposes. The released ReMind weights
(huggingface.co/AppliedIntuitionResearch/ReMind) are under the same license.
No weights are redistributed here.

